  "description": "Description of Development\n\nErection of a single-storey rear and side extension together with a loft conversion incorporating rear and front dormer windows.\n\nThe proposal includes a single-storey extension to the rear and side of the property, designed to integrate with the existing dwelling. In addition, the loft space will be converted to provide additional accommodation, including the construction of a rear dormer and a front dormer designed to match the character and appearance of similar dormer extensions within the street.\n\nThe dormer design, scale, and materials will reflect neighbouring properties to ensure consistency within the streetscene. External materials will match the existing dwellinghouse to maintain visual harmony.",
